Package: psdiets
Type: Package
Title: Process and Analyze Diet Data for Puget Sound Atlantis Model
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Hem Nalini", "Morzaria Luna",
      email = "hmorzarialuna@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Tools for processing and analyzing diet data from various sources
    for use in the Puget Sound Atlantis ecosystem model. Includes functions to
    clean salmon gut content data, assign prey to Atlantis functional groups,
    calculate diet proportions, and perform Dirichlet regression on diet matrices.
